                                "sense_id": "087f5ebe-617d-3ce5-951d-cba7e26ed451",
                                "text": "Midway through Donald McCaig’s unexpectedly diverting novel, “Rhett Butler’s People,” a black man about to be lynched in the post-bellum South asks Rhett to please shoot him dead before the mob breaks into the jail and does worse."
                            }
                        ]
